Before modifying the permissions, the existing ACL was inspected using icacls.

Command
icacls "%USERPROFILE%\Desktop\IT-LAB\Confidential"
Initial Permissions
CodexSandboxUsers       (RX)
SYSTEM                  (F)
Administrators          (F)
sanlly mora             (F)
Permission Reference
Permission	Meaning
F	Full Control
M	Modify
RX	Read & Execute
R	Read
W	Write

The (I) flag indicates that the permission is inherited.
